'''Downpour''' is the first new environment added in [[The Binding of Isaac: Repentance|Repentance]]. The theme of Downpour is flooded, haunted storm drains with many supernatural enemies and elements. Though there is some overlap with the {{s|Flooded Caves}} due to both featuring water flooding, the Flooded Caves' unique enemies are almost exclusively 'drowned' or 'bloated' as opposed to Downpour's more haunted theme.

[[Treasure Room|Treasure rooms]] in Downpour always have two items to choose from. One of the items will always be unknown; however, this can be circumvented with the {{I|Dream Catcher}}.

After {{a|A Secret Exit}} is unlocked, a locked door to Downpour I or II will appear upon completing the {{s|Basement}} / {{s|Cellar}} / {{s|Burning Basement}} I or II, respectively. The locked door requires a key to enter.

== Unique Elements ==
* '''Flooded Rooms''' - A layer of water covers all rooms in the floor, allowing certain enemies such as {{e|Small Leech|text=Small Leeches}} and {{e|Strider}}s to swim over flooded pits. {{E|Deep Gaper}}s can hide beneath the water and emerge when all other enemies in the room have been killed. The reflection visible in the water is also utilized by {{e|Wraith}}s, which are always visible in the reflection when they are otherwise invisible. 
* '''Lightning Flashes''' -  Lightning will occasionally strike, briefly brightening the room and revealing any Wraiths.

