== Knife Piece ==
Downpour II (or {{s|Dross}} II) contains the [[Mirrored World]] in which Isaac can acquire the {{I|Knife Piece 1}}, one of the quest items used to access {{s|Corpse}}. 

To access this area, Isaac can find the {{e|White Fire Place}} which spawns in a single room on the floor. Touching it converts Isaac into a ghostly form, resembling {{C|The Lost}}. Clearing any room will return Isaac to normal.
* The ghost form will hold the {{I|Holy Mantle}} if it is unlocked as a starting item for {{c|The Lost}}. The Holy Mantle will ''not'' be active until Isaac leaves the room.
* Interacting with Blood Donation Machines and Devil Beggars in the ghost form will kill Isaac despite having health in his normal form.

While in the ghost form, Isaac can then enter the mirror in the 1×1 room with a mirror on the icon, which leads Isaac to the '''[[Mirrored World]]''', where he can find {{I|Knife Piece 1}}.
* The mirror can be entered normally when playing as {{c|The Lost}}, {{c|Tainted Lost}}, {{C|Tainted Soul}}, or {{c|Tainted Jacob}} in his ghost form after being hit by {{e|Dark Esau}}. 

Once Isaac has cleared one room, has obtained the Knife Piece, and returns through the mirror back to the real world, he will be converted back to the original character. After acquiring the first Knife Piece, {{I|Knife Piece 2}} will now be accessible in {{s|Mines}} / {{s|Ashpit}} II.

''For further notes and details, see the [[Mirrored World]] page.''

