== Trivia ==
* Downpour is referred to on [[Isaac's last will|Isaac's Last Will]] as "Some Sewer".
* ''Antibirth'' used to have a different method of obtaining the first Knife Piece. Somewhere on the floor, there was a seemingly empty dead-end room with a minimap icon that indicated the room had a chest. Bombing the center of the room would open a hidden stone chest containing Knife Piece 1.
* In Antibirth, {{e|The Haunt}} could spawn as a boss.
** In [[Challenge Room#Boss Challenge Room|Boss Challenge Rooms]] in Downpour, The Haunt is one of the possible spawns, which is a nod to this.
* {{e|Gaper}}s and {{e|Frowning Gaper}}s are tinted blue if encountered. As well, {{e|Clotty|text=Clotties}} that spawn in the floor will appear wet and shiny.
* Almost any {{e|Spider}}s that spawn on this floor are replaced with {{e|Strider}}s, including those spawned from Red Chests and {{e|Shopkeeper}}s. The ones that spawn from a {{e|Big Spider}} are still normal spiders.

== Music ==
* The music for the Downpour is called ''[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qCfn8HicQNI River of Despair]''.
** An early version of this song was revealed during the pre-release of ''Repentance'', where it was titled "River of Despare".<ref>https://soundcloud.com/the_binding_of_isaac/river-of-despare</ref>
* ''River of Despair'' features heavy use of a theremin, an instrument commonly associated with the paranormal.

